# Debug variant of the standing editor image: dx-lum-uned + gdb, for the
# editor-tree oracle (log the editor's incremental bspAddNode calls during MAP
# REBUILD). Built once into `dx-lum-uned-dbg:latest` by build-dbg-image.sh.
# The base image is NEVER modified (memory: never prune/clobber dx-lum-uned).
FROM dx-lum-uned:latest
RUN apt-get update -q \
 && DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y -q --no-install-recommends gdb \
 && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
